\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Community Day Services<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_residential_living e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_residential_living\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_residential_living elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_residential_living\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/residential-living\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Residential Living<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_health_well_being e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_health_well_being\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_health_well_being elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_health_well_being\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/health-well-being\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Health &amp; Well Being<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-navrow_special_olympics e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"navrow_special_olympics\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nav_special_olympics elementor-align-left elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"nav_special_olympics\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-sm\" href=\"\/programs\/special-olympics\/\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-button-text\">Community Engagement<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-pg_content e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"pg_content\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_supporting-health e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_supporting-health\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"supporting-health\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_supporting-health_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_supporting-health_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Supporting Health, Independence, and Everyday Life<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-supporting-health_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"supporting-health_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At Good Shepherd Manor, health and wellness support each man\u2019s ability to enjoy the life he chooses. Spending time with friends, exploring interests, participating in Community Day programs, and feeling comfortable at home all depend on care that responds to individual needs.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-supporting-health_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"supporting-health_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our comprehensive health care program supports the men as their needs change, with attention to physical health, emotional well-being, personal choice, and dignity.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_mcallister-infirmary e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_mcallister-infirmary\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"mcallister-infirmary\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_mcallister-infirmary_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_mcallister-infirmary_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">On-Site Care at the McAllister Infirmary<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-mcallister-infirmary_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"mcallister-infirmary_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The 7,000-square-foot McAllister Infirmary provides a welcoming, accessible setting for on-site clinic space that includes medical care, nursing support, wellness services, and rehabilitation. Opened in 2004, the facility includes three examination and treatment rooms, three patient rooms equipped with audio and video monitoring, and rehabilitative equipment.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-mcallister-infirmary_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"mcallister-infirmary_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Nursing professionals are available during normal waking hours. Regular visits from a physician, podiatry services, physical therapy, and access to other specialists help bring care closer to home. Medical supplies and prescription medications further support each man\u2019s individual care needs.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-mcallister-infirmary_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"mcallister-infirmary_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1998\" height=\"1563\" src=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-2260\" alt=\"Two men working on classroom activities in Community Day Services\" srcset=\"https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1.jpg 1998w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-300x235.jpg 300w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1024x801.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-768x601.jpg 768w, https:\/\/goodshepherd.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/Day-Program-1-1536x1202.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1998px) 100vw, 1998px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-mcallister-infirmary_2_cap elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"mcallister-infirmary_2_cap\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><em>Placeholder photo \u2014 the McAllister Infirmary.<\/em><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_nursing e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_nursing\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"nursing\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_nursing_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_nursing_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Nursing Built on Relationships<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nursing_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"nursing_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our nurses get to know each man \u2014 his routines, preferences, communication style, and health needs. These relationships help the team recognize changes, respond to concerns, and offer reassurance during difficult moments.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nursing_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"nursing_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Nursing responsibilities include overseeing medications, monitoring ongoing health conditions, coordinating appointments, and developing individualized care plans with other providers. Preventive care and timely attention to concerns help the men stay comfortable, active, and involved in daily life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-nursing_2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"nursing_2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Care also means listening, celebrating progress, and helping each man feel understood and supported.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_voice-in-care e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_voice-in-care\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"voice-in-care\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_voice-in-care_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_voice-in-care_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">A Voice in Their Own Care<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-voice-in-care_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"voice-in-care_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We encourage each man to participate in his health care whenever possible. This may include learning about medications, describing symptoms, asking questions, or making informed choices about daily routines.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-voice-in-care_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"voice-in-care_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our nursing team advocates for inclusive, respectful care that recognizes each person\u2019s abilities and preferences. Working with families and providers, nurses help reduce barriers to care and support personal choice and self-determination.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_consistent-support e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_consistent-support\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"consistent-support\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_consistent-support_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_consistent-support_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Working Together for Consistent Support<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-consistent-support_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"consistent-support_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Health care at GSM is a shared effort. Nurses collaborate with direct support professionals (DSPs), families, physicians, therapists, pharmacies, and other providers to coordinate services around each man\u2019s needs.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-consistent-support_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"consistent-support_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Staff education and training help ensure everyday support is safe, consistent, and aligned with individualized care plans. Communication across departments helps connect medical recommendations with the routines and activities of home life.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_community-care e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_community-care\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"community-care\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_community-care_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_community-care_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Connecting with Community Care<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-community-care_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"community-care_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>When care is needed beyond campus, GSM provides transportation to community medical appointments and transportation back to the Manor following emergency room visits or hospital stays. Coordination with outside providers supports continuity as the men return home.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-community-care_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"community-care_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For men who need hospice services, GSM works with Uplifted Care to support comfort, dignity, and compassionate care in collaboration with each man\u2019s care team and family.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-sec_closing e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"sec_closing\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"closing\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-s_closing_h2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"s_closing_h2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Making Home Happen Starts with Health and Wellness<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-closing_0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"closing_0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Every health concern addressed, appointment coordinated, and moment of reassurance contributes to life at home. Our nursing team works alongside colleagues throughout GSM to help each man live safely, comfortably, and as independently as possible.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-closing_1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"closing_1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Together, we support the health and well-being that allow the men to enjoy friendships, pursue interests, and thrive in the place they call home.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Health &amp; Well Being On-site nursing, clinic, pharmacy, and community health supports. On-site nursing, clinic, pharmacy, and community health supports. Divider On-site nursing, clinic, pharmacy, and community health supports. What We Offer We work alongside families, volunteers, and donors to make a meaningful difference in the daily lives of the men we serve. Learn More [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":317,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"no-sidebar","site-content-layout":"page-builder","ast-site-content-layout":"full-width-container","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"disabled","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"disabled","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"disabled","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"enabled","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-st